u00e1x. 64), Filtro de servicios de red (m\u00e1x. 32), Filtro de URL (m\u00e1x. 64)<\/li>  <li><b>Control de tr\u00e1fico:<\/b> Limitador de ancho de banda (m\u00e1x. 32 reglas), QoS tradicional (m\u00e1x. 32 reglas)<\/li>  <li><b>Monitor de tr\u00e1fico:<\/b> Monitor en tiempo real, tr\u00e1fico por cable, tr\u00e1fico inal\u00e1mbrico, an\u00e1lisis de tr\u00e1fico diario, semanal, mensual<\/li>  <li><b>WAN:<\/b> Tipos de conexi\u00f3n: PPPoE, PPTP, L2TP, IP autom\u00e1tica, IP est\u00e1tica, WAN dual, Reenv\u00edo de puertos (m\u00e1x. 64 reglas), Triggering de puertos (m\u00e1x. 32 reglas), DMZ, DDNS, NAT Passthrough: PPTP, L2TP, IPSec, RTSP, H.323, SIP, PPPoE relay<\/li>  <li><b>LAN:<\/b> Servidor DHCP, IGMP Snooping, IPTV, Asignaci\u00f3n manual de IP (m\u00e1x. 64 reglas), Wake on LAN (WOL)<\/li>  <li><b>Inal\u00e1mbrico:<\/b> SSID UTF-8, Filtro MAC (m\u00e1x. 64), Programaci\u00f3n inal\u00e1mbrica, Airtime Fairness, Cliente RADIUS, Beamforming expl\u00edcito<\/li>  <li><b>Aplicaci\u00f3n USB:<\/b> Sistema de archivos: FAT16, FAT32, NT3G<\/li>  <li><b>Administraci\u00f3n:<\/b> Copia de seguridad y restauraci\u00f3n de configuraci\u00f3n, herramientas de diagn\u00f3stico, sistema de retroalimentaci\u00f3n, registro del sistema<\/li><\/ul>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ASUS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.8,"unit_price":35.6,"unit_price_tax":35.6,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Conectividad","sub_category":"Router WIFI","quantity":5,"brand":"ASUS","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_asu-rou%20rt-ac1200%20v2_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":28.6}}},"4977766839204":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false]